==Battleground==
*4 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 22.67~25.33 seconds<sup>680f~760f</sup>.
*1 [[Guile (Enemy)|Guile]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 15.33~18.67 seconds<sup>460f~560f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 32~35.33 seconds<sup>960f~1,060f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Guile is only at 2% magnification and the peons only 100%.

